            <li><m>f(g(5))=0</m></li>
            <li><m>g(g(2))=2</m></li>
            <li>There is insuffient information given to compute.</li>
            <li><m>f(g(3))=1</m></li>
    </ol>
        </p>
        </answer><!--Statement of the answer (don't worry about location in the rendered version)-->
  </exercise><!--End of that exercise-->

    <exercise>
   <statement>
   <p>Suppose <m>g(x)</m> is given in the graph below and <m>h(x)</m> is given in the table below:</p>
   <image source="Functions/PracExercise3.png"/>
   <table>
        <tabular top="medium">
          <row left="medium" bottom="medium">
